<title>USA: Patterson Energy sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Patterson Energy sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SNYDER, Texas 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patterson Energy Inc said Tuesday its board has approved a two-for-one split of its common shares, with the additional shares to be distributed on July 25 to stockholders of record on July 11.</p>
<p>The split will raise the company's common stock outstanding to 14.74 million shares, it said.</p>
<p>Patterson Energy provides domestic land drilling services to major and independent oil and gas companies.  It is also engaged in oil and natural gas exploration and production.</p>
</text>
